============================================================
8) HIGH-LEVEL IMPACT
============================================================
These changes significantly improve resilience in production conditions:
- Recoverability from dispatch/network partial failures
- Protection from duplicate work and excess AI costs
- Controlled behavior during AI provider outages
- Better debuggability across distributed components
